sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant API as Spring Boot
    participant MySQL
    participant Redis
    participant Claude as Claude Haiku 4.5
    participant OpenAI
    participant Qdrant

    Admin->>API: POST /api/documents/upload (ROLE_ADMIN)

    API->>MySQL: Duplicate check (same fileName, status != FAILED)
    alt Already exists
        API-->>Admin: 200 skipped — no duplicate embedding cost
    end

    API->>API: Save temp file to disk (name = taskId UUID)
    API->>MySQL: INSERT status=PENDING, taskId
    API->>Redis: SET ingest task = PENDING (TTL 24h)
    API-->>Admin: 200 OK with taskId

    Note over API: Background — @Async("taskExecutor"), IngestionRunner

    API->>Redis: task = PROCESSING
    API->>MySQL: status = PROCESSING

    API->>API: TextExtractor — Tika parse to plain text
    API->>API: ChunkSplitter — Markdown headings, fallback semantic (chunkSize~1000, overlap 150)
    API->>API: Stamp base metadata (docId, fileName, category, chunkIndex, chunkTotal)

    API->>Claude: ChunkMetadataEnricher — tag chunks in batches of 5 (parallel, throttled)
    Claude-->>API: intent_tags, behavioral_tags, chunk_type, project, skills

    API->>Claude: RAPTOR DocumentSummarizer — 1 summary chunk (prepended at index 0)
    Claude-->>API: document summary

    opt Contextual Retrieval (disabled by default)
        API->>Claude: Per-chunk context prefix (prepended before embedding)
        Claude-->>API: context prefix
    end

    API->>OpenAI: Embed all chunks in batches of 100 (text-embedding-3-small)
    OpenAI-->>API: float[1536] dense vectors

    API->>API: QdrantPointAssembler — BM25 sparse vectors + company tags + enrichment payload
    API->>Qdrant: Upsert points (dense + sparse + payload)
    Qdrant-->>API: OK

    API->>MySQL: status = COMPLETED, chunk_count = N
    API->>Redis: task = COMPLETED
    API->>API: Update IDF corpus (idf_corpus.json)

    alt Any step fails
        API->>MySQL: status = FAILED, error_message (truncated 500 chars)
        API->>Redis: task = FAILED
    end

    Note over API: finally — delete temp file from disk
